## BEFORE PROCEEDING (Auto-LF or manual)

1. Identify the **currently visible** Sprinklr case (one Fall #).  
2. If ambiguous Fall # → STOP and ask.  
3. Confirm channel **CALL** vs **EMAIL**.

## RUN LF

```powershell
# EMAIL non-transfer (Transfer Nein — script may auto-resolve)
uv run python .cursor/skills/fill-microsoft-form/fill_case_tracker.py --case-id "#FALL_ID"

# EMAIL / CALL transfer
uv run python .cursor/skills/fill-microsoft-form/fill_case_tracker.py --case-id "#FALL_ID" --transfer 1 --target "TRANSFER_TARGET"

# CALL non-transfer
uv run python .cursor/skills/fill-microsoft-form/fill_case_tracker.py --case-id "#FALL_ID" --channel voice
```

Script auto-reads **Ziel / Quelle** for Transfer when `--transfer` / `--target` are omitted. **Salcus** only from exclusive Kundennummer box. Do **not** pass `--salcus` from email/Webform.

### Open / reuse tracker tab

- Reuse open `roberta.yoummday.com/casetracker/` tab; else open new from Sprinklr context.  
- Login gate → `config.json` credentials.  
- **Do not** click **Speichern** unless user asks (`--submit`).  
- After fill, Case Tracker tab may stay focused.

### Field mapping (Sprinklr → Roberta)

| Roberta field | Selector | Source on Sprinklr | Rule |
|---------------|----------|-------------------|------|
| Case # | `input[name="sikas"]` | Fall # (visible case) | Digits only; `#` optional |
| Salcus | `input[name="salcus"]` | **Exclusive:** `div[data-entityid="Kundennummer"][aria-label="Kundennummer"]`. Re-read every Fall. | **Never** from email body / Webform / other DOM |
| Kanal | `#channel_em_care` / `#channel_voice` | **EMAIL:** E-Mail Care. **CALL:** Voice | |
| Transfer | `#transfer0` / `#transfer1` | See transfer rules | |
| Target | `input[name="target"]` | Matrix Ziel-Kontakt / Sprinklr Ziel | Only when Transfer = Ja |
| Ticketstatus Salcus | `#tstate1` / `#tstate3` | Derived — **CALL always `#tstate3`** | |
| Notiz | `input[name="note"]` | — | **Always empty** |

### Salcus (mandatory — exclusive source)

**Hard rule:** Roberta **Salcus** only from:

`div[data-entityid="Kundennummer"][aria-label="Kundennummer"]`

| Displayed value | Roberta Salcus |
|-----------------|----------------|
| Numeric Kundennummer (`htmlText`) | Those digits |
| **`C-…` Vertragsnummer** | **Empty** (not Salcus) |
| **Nicht festgelegt** / missing | **Empty** |

Prefer `[data-testid="htmlText"]` first; else `span.spr-text-03` for unset. Never invent Salcus from the email body.

### Ticketstatus Salcus

| Condition | Select |
|-----------|--------|
| **CALL / Voice** | **3** always |
| **Transfer = Ja** | **3** always |
| Transfer Nein + valid numeric Salcus | **1-Erfolgreich** |
| Transfer Nein + empty / `C-…` | **3** |

### Transfer (mandatory)

**Never** Transfer Ja to `*CARE_ALLGEMEIN*`. Prefer **TransferMatrix** Ziel-Kontakt for Auto-LF when §3 says transfer; else script `resolve_transfer()` from Quelle/Ziel.

| Signal | Transfer | Target |
|--------|----------|--------|
| Care Widerruf Quelle (not Webform) | Ja | `CBC_XF_E_WIDERRUF` |
| Our Care team / CARE_ALLGEMEIN | Nein | empty |
| External queue / email Ziel | Ja | that Ziel |
| Unset Ziel | Nein | empty |

